    "type": "game",
    "name": "Voltage Box",
    "steam_appid": 3105770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voltage Box</strong> is a challenging puzzle game where players must overcome obstacles to activate a set number of switches in each level. For those who love a challenge, try activating all the switches and collecting all stars in each level to achieve a perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Activation</strong>: Players must activate switches or collect stars as specified in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Entry</strong>: Players must control multiple characters simultaneously and guide them all to designated star locations together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Collection</strong>: Players must collect scattered stars throughout the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to give puzzle lovers a challenging experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a variety of difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many levels with special difficulty for those who enjoy high challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty gradually increases after level 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime to finish: 3-5 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For full completion: about 10-15 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo version available with the same content as the full version, limited to the first 10 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the Demo version (first 10 levels of the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 main levels to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique background images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mission modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay from start to finish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and easy-to-understand mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language barriers during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted paths for an enjoyable and challenging experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for completing each level perfectly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare scores with other players worldwide in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the fun, excitement, and puzzle-solving headaches in this game!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voltage Box</strong> is a challenging puzzle game where players must overcome obstacles to activate a set number of switches in each level. For those who love a challenge, try activating all the switches and collecting all stars in each level to achieve a perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Activation</strong>: Players must activate switches or collect stars as specified in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Entry</strong>: Players must control multiple characters simultaneously and guide them all to designated star locations together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Collection</strong>: Players must collect scattered stars throughout the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to give puzzle lovers a challenging experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a variety of difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many levels with special difficulty for those who enjoy high challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty gradually increases after level 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime to finish: 3-5 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For full completion: about 10-15 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo version available with the same content as the full version, limited to the first 10 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the Demo version (first 10 levels of the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 main levels to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique background images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mission modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay from start to finish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and easy-to-understand mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language barriers during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted paths for an enjoyable and challenging experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for completing each level perfectly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare scores with other players worldwide in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the fun, excitement, and puzzle-solving headaches in this game!</strong></p>",
